  "question": {
    "text": "The atomic structure of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> arises due to transition from <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> to <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> level. If <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is 3 and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> is 1. Find the <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></math> in nm of transition for this series in <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> in nm."
  },
